    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11687" root="خور" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُورَةٌ الإِبِلِ</span></b> , with damm, [app. originally <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُيْرَة</span>,]
<i>The best of camels,</i> or <i>of the camels;</i> (IAar, K;)
[see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَيْرٌ</span>, (in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خير</span>,) near the end of the paragraph;] and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُوَارُهَا</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْهَا</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الخُورَى</span></b> . (Fr,
TA.)

